{
  "area": "turks-caicos-providenciales",
  "method": "Providenciales (Grace Bay, Northwest Point, south-side banks), West Caicos and French Cay; Pine Cay sites are recorded as excluded because they fall outside the area label. Lists: (1) the official dive-boat mooring list, the Turks & Caicos Reef Fund's 'Dive Mooring List' of 20 Oct 2016 (installed under its memorandum of understanding with the Department of Environment and Coastal Resources; the Reef Fund's own site-map page shows the same sites and counts as the same list), with its coordinates converted from degrees and decimal minutes to decimal degrees; (2) the Visit Turks and Caicos tourism board's 2026 dive sites map, read from the map image; (3) Dive Provo's published site list. Each counts once. A site is counted when it is named, divable and on at least two of the three; aliases are merged by name or by the tourism board's own 'also' marks (Aquarium West is the tourism board's and Dive Provo's Aquarium; Stairway is Coral Stairway; Whiteface is The Anchor; Molasses Reef is the Molasses Reef Wreck). Sites on one list only, including mooring-list names no shop or board repeats, are excluded, as are Pine Cay and the shore snorkel reef Smith's Reef. Bight Reef is not on any list read. Other operators were tried: Flamingo Divers, Caicos Adventures, Big Blue Collective, Caicos Dream Tours (snorkel only) and Art Pickering's Provo Turtle Divers publish no site list (the last domain now serves another business); the Aggressor and Explorer Ventures liveaboard site lists could not be fetched, so neither is counted. Counted 2026-10-14.",
